            "\n",
            "Grouped by Channel:\n",
            "         count   mean  median    std    min     max\n",
            "channel                                            \n",
            "Online      99  35.65   32.78  17.01  10.27  119.70\n",
            "Store      100  39.55   30.64  27.84   9.21  190.25\n"
          ]
